{"2026.5.28:P01-Q03":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>硝酸分解检验与分水器装置</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.28 · 雅礼一模 · 原题3 · P01-Q03</div><h1>硝酸分解检验与分水器装置</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学实验基础/探究性实验/化学实验方案的设计与评价</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：分析挥发干扰、移水促进酯化、变量控制和酸碱滴定指示剂。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学实验基础/物质检验与物质含量的测定/物质的检验</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/酯</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/影响化学平衡的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学反应速率/影响化学反应速率的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/酸碱中和滴定</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H~1 C~12 O~16 Mg~24 Si~28 Cl~35.5 K~39 Co~59 Ge~73</p><p>3. 利用下图所示实验仪器、装置及药品(夹持装置已省略)能达到实验目的的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:c49cb2606dca27e348fbb7cd12ca549bf8b60619514366c36d77c191a5a28217:0;\" style=\"width:550.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 图①装置b中溶液变蓝能够说明浓<img src=\"chem-asset:b3b79cade09b34801974eeaa59f8e617346d6f81d372c9227f4b3491ae7ae812:1;\" style=\"width:44.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">分解生成<img src=\"chem-asset:7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a:2;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 图②用分水器提高反应物转化率</p><p>C. 图③依据褪色时间的长短，能证明反应物质浓度对反应速率的影响</p><p>D. 图④用盐酸标准液测氨水浓度</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．浓硝酸受热分解会生成<img src=\"chem-asset:7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a:2;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，但浓硝酸本身具有挥发性，挥发出的蒸气也能将KI氧化为I<sub>2</sub>，使淀粉溶液变蓝。因此，无法仅凭b中溶液变蓝，证明是<img src=\"chem-asset:7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a:2;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">导致的，A错误；</p><p>B．图②为乙酸乙酯的制备装置，分水器的作用是及时分离出反应生成的水。根据勒夏特列原理，生成物浓度降低，会使酯化反应<img src=\"chem-asset:780a5235cdcba41789664d6f2a8c6866d68a913136abbdbb6f935fc4d69efcb3:3;\" style=\"width:318.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡正向移动，从而提高乙酸、乙醇的转化率，B正确；</p><p>C．要探究浓度对反应速率的影响，必须保证除浓度外的其他变量完全相同。图③中两组实验的<img src=\"chem-asset:f3593e8dce53ed4f9275267ffee2246c4453c0c644c07db535d89838a94b1659:4;\" style=\"width:53.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">浓度不同，导致初始颜色深浅不同，无法通过褪色时间长短准确比较反应速率，C错误；</p><p>D．盐酸标准液滴定氨水时，滴定终点时溶液呈弱酸性。而酚酞的变色范围为8.2~10.0（碱性），在滴定终点前就会褪色，无法准确判断滴定终点，应选用甲基橙作指示剂，D错误；</p><p>故答案选B。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.28\\精品解析：2026届湖南长沙市雅礼中学高三下学期一模化学试题\\精品解析：2026届湖南长沙市雅礼中学高三下学期一模化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.28/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A2026%E5%B1%8A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%80%E6%A8%A1%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A2026%E5%B1%8A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%80%E6%A8%A1%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["780a5235cdcba41789664d6f2a8c6866d68a913136abbdbb6f935fc4d69efcb3","7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a","b3b79cade09b34801974eeaa59f8e617346d6f81d372c9227f4b3491ae7ae812","c49cb2606dca27e348fbb7cd12ca549bf8b60619514366c36d77c191a5a28217","f3593e8dce53ed4f9275267ffee2246c4453c0c644c07db535d89838a94b1659"],"refs":{"chem-asset:c49cb2606dca27e348fbb7cd12ca549bf8b60619514366c36d77c191a5a28217:0;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/c49cb2606dca27e348fbb7cd.png","chem-asset:b3b79cade09b34801974eeaa59f8e617346d6f81d372c9227f4b3491ae7ae812:1;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/767d157f4b5c18dc3ab7f17a.png","chem-asset:7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a:2;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/6a2ad8519e6712ccf65728ba.png","chem-asset:780a5235cdcba41789664d6f2a8c6866d68a913136abbdbb6f935fc4d69efcb3:3;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/5e7e959b47503e110f2eea34.png","chem-asset:f3593e8dce53ed4f9275267ffee2246c4453c0c644c07db535d89838a94b1659:4;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/a21185ef290d6804e91dea44.png"},"sourceSha256":"9bd0e255b6d1ef8efa0a5fb38e700a571226f6c055bba35eab731b2537fca0c2","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学实验基础/探究性实验/化学实验方案的设计与评价/2026.5.28/P01-Q03_硝酸分解检验与分水器装置.html"},"2026.5.28:P02-Q08":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>三原子分子构型与碳核素</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.28 · 华师大附中四月阶段练习 · 原题8 · P02-Q08</div><h1>三原子分子构型与碳核素</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/分子的构型及相关理论</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：根据八电子结构推断元素，比较键角、极性并判断放射性核素用途。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/元素周期表 元素周期律/元素周期律</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/电离能 电负性</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/原子的构成结构</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H-1  C-12  O-16  S-32  Cu-64</p><p>8. 甲、乙、丙均是第二周期的非金属元素X、Y、Z、W组成的三原子分子，分子中所有原子均满足8电子稳定结构，相关信息如下表：</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>分子</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>甲</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>乙</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>丙</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>组成元素</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>W、X</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>W、X、Y</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>X、Y、Z</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>中心原子</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>W</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Y</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Z</p></td></tr></table></div><p>下列说法正确的是</p><p>A. 键角：乙&lt;甲　B. 甲、乙、丙中有一种非极性分子</p><p>C. YX<sub>3</sub>的空间结构为平面三角形　D. Z的一种核素可用于考古断代</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】甲、乙、丙均为第二周期非金属组成的三原子分子且分子中所有原子均满足8电子稳定结构，甲为两种元素W、X组成的三原子分子，中心为W，可推得甲为<img src=\"chem-asset:875c275c346e1a2a31910eefa9c81989030cd667b45464da0b65e69e0da1ddf3:0;\" style=\"width:103.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">：W为<img src=\"chem-asset:93e6aa3511049d4cc47390e66136912f0b1edb0e3dee86e680065b3ee641eb3d:1;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，X为<img src=\"chem-asset:f932c546d86d0b0f19b4bb4f5efc5fe83d3085a19d1d5cecc78c12bb8dfaa8db:2;\" style=\"width:17.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，均满足8电子结构；乙为W、X、Y组成的三原子分子，中心为Y，可推得乙为<img src=\"chem-asset:a57da078161ac9de5c764d1897414795447224b0cd65304d4fbd30e6fcbc1da1:3;\" style=\"width:37.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(F-N=O)，Y为<img src=\"chem-asset:98546cec19db5929402158c01a8e4ab6169c5743506d518a02f98e6848a7875c:4;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，所有原子满足8电子结构；丙为X、Y、Z组成的三原子分子，中心为Z，可推得丙为<img src=\"chem-asset:43b6c5c1f1437c9f42ecb269e964ee83dffe545cfb62c874a9c0a6e2e06c3f15:5;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(F-C<img src=\"chem-asset:ce5d44698c96b767dc3b1915986a1b6e31db61c862c13a3ba800b1a55987c76f:6;\" style=\"width:13.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">N)，Z为<img src=\"chem-asset:78071eadec8f277f908abe5a0cbcb5dd6d5ad7f7753f74d8f11c808b5614bfb2:7;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，所有原子满足8电子结构。</p><p>【详解】A．甲<img src=\"chem-asset:5ed1c59e2fe0c085e0ff91e03f14f7fd5de5176350398aca8e306b22eeb15246:8;\" style=\"width:29.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中心<img src=\"chem-asset:93e6aa3511049d4cc47390e66136912f0b1edb0e3dee86e680065b3ee641eb3d:1;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的价层电子对数为<img src=\"chem-asset:e3fb5600bdc008b6c59ab37d6ef9cb88cf0655a6aaf6dae7ce3f34d5f437590e:9;\" style=\"width:148.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，采取<img src=\"chem-asset:04d4e5a338b4a4f1ad7d7a887c9a511029245296bf664731ca13aa183608e743:10;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">杂化，有2对孤电子对；乙<img src=\"chem-asset:a57da078161ac9de5c764d1897414795447224b0cd65304d4fbd30e6fcbc1da1:3;\" style=\"width:37.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中心N的价层电子对数为<img src=\"chem-asset:016e40c13e2182e035dc0de557023d67959e59cdcdc5752f1ab2b399dde27986:11;\" style=\"width:144.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:98546cec19db5929402158c01a8e4ab6169c5743506d518a02f98e6848a7875c:4;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">采取<img src=\"chem-asset:8160734a06d5ad68b379b54da12bb09a877d155a0c4736b563204d5587bc257b:12;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">杂化，只有1对孤电子对，故键角：乙&gt;甲，A错误；</p><p>B．甲<img src=\"chem-asset:5ed1c59e2fe0c085e0ff91e03f14f7fd5de5176350398aca8e306b22eeb15246:8;\" style=\"width:29.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、乙<img src=\"chem-asset:a57da078161ac9de5c764d1897414795447224b0cd65304d4fbd30e6fcbc1da1:3;\" style=\"width:37.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为V形极性分子，丙<img src=\"chem-asset:43b6c5c1f1437c9f42ecb269e964ee83dffe545cfb62c874a9c0a6e2e06c3f15:5;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为直线形但两端原子电负性差异大，正负电中心不重合，也是极性分子，无非极性分子，B错误；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:26ea3617eeee02f43ecc71e10972eec47cc0ff4ad4c51b3a99a6a581595b4426:13;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为<img src=\"chem-asset:be7f6e0a31874bb12da3b6afb8a5a43331d37aa466ce3c306a6f86cbf205c5e8:14;\" style=\"width:29.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，中心<img src=\"chem-asset:98546cec19db5929402158c01a8e4ab6169c5743506d518a02f98e6848a7875c:4;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价层电子对数为<img src=\"chem-asset:5f9de17c23e129ad9ac2db3fce3bbcb0eed97bdd880273b7c216a730ee2e770d:15;\" style=\"width:98.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，含1对孤电子对，空间结构为三角锥形，C错误；</p><p>D．Z为<img src=\"chem-asset:78071eadec8f277f908abe5a0cbcb5dd6d5ad7f7753f74d8f11c808b5614bfb2:7;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，其核素<img src=\"chem-asset:8c13ce3bceb7f3438e0417b9ec253b14e24a268bfaa91ee02e775bc7cb1944de:16;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">具有放射性，可用于考古断代，D正确；</p><p>故选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.28\\精品解析：湖北华中师范大学第一附属中学等校2026届高三年级四月阶段练习化学试题\\精品解析：湖北华中师范大学第一附属中学等校2026届高三年级四月阶段练习化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.28/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8C%97%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%88%E8%8C%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E5%B9%B4%E7%BA%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8C%97%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%88%E8%8C%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E5%B9%B4%E7%BA%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["016e40c13e2182e035dc0de557023d67959e59cdcdc5752f1ab2b399dde27986","04d4e5a338b4a4f1ad7d7a887c9a511029245296bf664731ca13aa183608e743","26ea3617eeee02f43ecc71e10972eec47cc0ff4ad4c51b3a99a6a581595b4426","43b6c5c1f1437c9f42ecb269e964ee83dffe545cfb62c874a9c0a6e2e06c3f15","5ed1c59e2fe0c085e0ff91e03f14f7fd5de5176350398aca8e306b22eeb15246","5f9de17c23e129ad9ac2db3fce3bbcb0eed97bdd880273b7c216a730ee2e770d","78071eadec8f277f908abe5a0cbcb5dd6d5ad7f7753f74d8f11c808b5614bfb2","8160734a06d5ad68b379b54da12bb09a877d155a0c4736b563204d5587bc257b","875c275c346e1a2a31910eefa9c81989030cd667b45464da0b65e69e0da1ddf3","8c13ce3bceb7f3438e0417b9ec253b14e24a268bfaa91ee02e775bc7cb1944de","93e6aa3511049d4cc47390e66136912f0b1edb0e3dee86e680065b3ee641eb3d","98546cec19db5929402158c01a8e4ab6169c5743506d518a02f98e6848a7875c","a57da078161ac9de5c764d1897414795447224b0cd65304d4fbd30e6fcbc1da1","be7f6e0a31874bb12da3b6afb8a5a43331d37aa466ce3c306a6f86cbf205c5e8","ce5d44698c96b767dc3b1915986a1b6e31db61c862c13a3ba800b1a55987c76f","e3fb5600bdc008b6c59ab37d6ef9cb88cf0655a6aaf6dae7ce3f34d5f437590e","f932c546d86d0b0f19b4bb4f5efc5fe83d3085a19d1d5cecc78c12bb8dfaa8db"],"refs":{"chem-asset:875c275c346e1a2a31910eefa9c81989030cd667b45464da0b65e69e0da1ddf3:0;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/5f0df6cddc61cb37344c98cd.png","chem-asset:93e6aa3511049d4cc47390e66136912f0b1edb0e3dee86e680065b3ee641eb3d:1;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/533a345e7eca6ff60e75178a.png","chem-asset:f932c546d86d0b0f19b4bb4f5efc5fe83d3085a19d1d5cecc78c12bb8dfaa8db:2;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/55033cb456eddb109a3a5515.png","chem-asset:a57da078161ac9de5c764d1897414795447224b0cd65304d4fbd30e6fcbc1da1:3;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3707350438818562bf1d3f73.png","chem-asset:98546cec19db5929402158c01a8e4ab6169c5743506d518a02f98e6848a7875c:4;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/a98876acf5fce47d78e7dcb6.png","chem-asset:43b6c5c1f1437c9f42ecb269e964ee83dffe545cfb62c874a9c0a6e2e06c3f15:5;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/fd135d36b29b6d4811009e50.png","chem-asset:ce5d44698c96b767dc3b1915986a1b6e31db61c862c13a3ba800b1a55987c76f:6;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/401f9de1a5d3f22a639c017a.png","chem-asset:78071eadec8f277f908abe5a0cbcb5dd6d5ad7f7753f74d8f11c808b5614bfb2:7;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/df94adcfc9b6e03c0f8a722e.png","chem-asset:5ed1c59e2fe0c085e0ff91e03f14f7fd5de5176350398aca8e306b22eeb15246:8;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7cc6de9ab9a2813280ec5f5a.png","chem-asset:e3fb5600bdc008b6c59ab37d6ef9cb88cf0655a6aaf6dae7ce3f34d5f437590e:9;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/d87fd02513da7aa57b987c39.png","chem-asset:04d4e5a338b4a4f1ad7d7a887c9a511029245296bf664731ca13aa183608e743:10;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/e8bdf0c3abc6f3c7362d62f6.png","chem-asset:016e40c13e2182e035dc0de557023d67959e59cdcdc5752f1ab2b399dde27986:11;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/68ded00def731f8f12c3d7d9.png","chem-asset:8160734a06d5ad68b379b54da12bb09a877d155a0c4736b563204d5587bc257b:12;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b85c08f8b95e80f053e32c7a.png","chem-asset:26ea3617eeee02f43ecc71e10972eec47cc0ff4ad4c51b3a99a6a581595b4426:13;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3efc3936ff7481f2d61ba79c.png","chem-asset:be7f6e0a31874bb12da3b6afb8a5a43331d37aa466ce3c306a6f86cbf205c5e8:14;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7939bf8cdbd1da024ca9d24d.png","chem-asset:5f9de17c23e129ad9ac2db3fce3bbcb0eed97bdd880273b7c216a730ee2e770d:15;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/6058734b18271e207202b9a4.png","chem-asset:8c13ce3bceb7f3438e0417b9ec253b14e24a268bfaa91ee02e775bc7cb1944de:16;":"../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/0c477bde424819067a4acd14.png"},"sourceSha256":"a501bf31438d7dae6a3f03144f036e1acc218783d98b4a7fb2a6cb784a9e2558","bom":false,"legacyPath":"物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/分子的构型及相关理论/2026.5.28/P02-Q08_三原子分子构型与碳核素.html"},"2026.5.28:P03-Q05":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>含铜物质转化离子方程式</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.28 · 师大附中二模 · 原题5 · P03-Q05</div><h1>含铜物质转化离子方程式</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：依据氧化还原、沉淀和配位检查铜物质转化及甲醛氧化表达。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/醛类</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/沉淀溶解平衡/沉淀溶解平衡的应用</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H～1  C～12  O～16  Na～23  S～32  Ti～48  Cu～64  Br～80  In～115  Te～128</p><p>5. 不同含铜物质间可相互转化。下列离子方程式书写错误的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:c21259b68a6f254bc7430dfa7b953db53ad06e8cd53260c4000a99039b778ff2:0;\" style=\"width:528.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>已知：第③步加入的甲醛溶液为少量。</p><p>A. 反应①：<img src=\"chem-asset:ef7a972b48c17c3258e78fc56dda9dc1d2eea2e8af22fc07a43f61305631c41b:1;\" style=\"width:216.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 反应②：<img src=\"chem-asset:566b5aeb17e9b27352e4d64b56a43654c2433011432af1b01b71b8785dfd20b0:2;\" style=\"width:180.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 反应③：<img src=\"chem-asset:37ca3a69ef1ced426374100b580b2253ae8d2768ea33570651bd430040a53b39:3;\" style=\"width:356.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. 反应④：<img src=\"chem-asset:71c16bb8e5ada94228a28a62abfda15b610503d30ac5724a7b29c8e9c2a1cc9a:4;\" style=\"width:338.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．反应①酸性条件下<img src=\"chem-asset:e429d324fbb9588b2b8ceadedc6697beb3de97de12abf982df6eb2353dc45cf4:5;\" style=\"width:24.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">被<img src=\"chem-asset:7d0049f04c619dbff6c77add34f7f4d40eeef9c6c28ac4d03d4b8bf54fa31a17:6;\" style=\"width:39.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed:7;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，同时<img src=\"chem-asset:7d0049f04c619dbff6c77add34f7f4d40eeef9c6c28ac4d03d4b8bf54fa31a17:6;\" style=\"width:39.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">被还原为<img src=\"chem-asset:7c2baf2285e55583d60c21307602ad1ca2b0cb04b00fe21753e47d5233cd385c:8;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，离子方程式的电荷、原子、得失电子均守恒，A正确；</p><p>B．反应②是可溶性铜盐与强碱反应生成<img src=\"chem-asset:8ba1d31457e234a020983fe9628ff9fb2aa61b5412926482ea7a34434249dcc7:9;\" style=\"width:64.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">沉淀，离子方程式拆分和守恒均正确，B正确；</p><p>C．甲醛与新制氢氧化铜在碱性条件下共热，发生氧化还原反应，（已知甲醛少量）甲醛被氧化为碳酸盐，1 mol <img src=\"chem-asset:2f71c1784d7e7ed3fbd58bf4530f726153fb16ef4038270a89c9e25dcbde6d8f:10;\" style=\"width:51.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">完全氧化时，需要4mol氢氧化铜，并生成2mol氧化亚铜 ，离子方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:60c578b3203bdc57947db018051471fedaafe843b0b5e3b8dcad7378784468a6:11;\" style=\"width:333.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，甲醛少量时不会出现甲酸盐，选项中离子方程式错误，C错误；</p><p>D．<img src=\"chem-asset:6002d7015809d896f8182060a847b53f5b4791ec895f1dccb69d3febf0d18237:12;\" style=\"width:41.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与氨水反应生成<img src=\"chem-asset:6b2035571470f95241331dee9c08b0289a0ac92ce4dd821ddb4336a3b06f1dba:13;\" style=\"width:88.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">配离子，离子方程式的电荷、原子均守恒，D正确；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.28\\精品解析：湖南师范大学附属中学2026届高三下学期二模化学试题\\精品解析：湖南师范大学附属中学2026届高三下学期二模化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.28/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%88%E8%8C%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%A1%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%88%E8%8C%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%A1%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["2f71c1784d7e7ed3fbd58bf4530f726153fb16ef4038270a89c9e25dcbde6d8f","37ca3a69ef1ced426374100b580b2253ae8d2768ea33570651bd430040a53b39","566b5aeb17e9b27352e4d64b56a43654c2433011432af1b01b71b8785dfd20b0","6002d7015809d896f8182060a847b53f5b4791ec895f1dccb69d3febf0d18237","60c578b3203bdc57947db018051471fedaafe843b0b5e3b8dcad7378784468a6","6b2035571470f95241331dee9c08b0289a0ac92ce4dd821ddb4336a3b06f1dba","71c16bb8e5ada94228a28a62abfda15b610503d30ac5724a7b29c8e9c2a1cc9a","7c2baf2285e55583d60c21307602ad1ca2b0cb04b00fe21753e47d5233cd385c","7d0049f04c619dbff6c77add34f7f4d40eeef9c6c28ac4d03d4b8bf54fa31a17","8ba1d31457e234a020983fe9628ff9fb2aa61b5412926482ea7a34434249dcc7","c21259b68a6f254bc7430dfa7b953db53ad06e8cd53260c4000a99039b778ff2","d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed","e429d324fbb9588b2b8ceadedc6697beb3de97de12abf982df6eb2353dc45cf4","ef7a972b48c17c3258e78fc56dda9dc1d2eea2e8af22fc07a43f61305631c41b"],"refs":{"chem-asset:c21259b68a6f254bc7430dfa7b953db53ad06e8cd53260c4000a99039b778ff2:0;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3f73ed787f3292c514c2ddc6.png","chem-asset:ef7a972b48c17c3258e78fc56dda9dc1d2eea2e8af22fc07a43f61305631c41b:1;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/e3955c5adf16f69d944c68e8.png","chem-asset:566b5aeb17e9b27352e4d64b56a43654c2433011432af1b01b71b8785dfd20b0:2;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/0158d2df0bea71d831bb7d2a.png","chem-asset:37ca3a69ef1ced426374100b580b2253ae8d2768ea33570651bd430040a53b39:3;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b6716f68dde157b96ff552e0.png","chem-asset:71c16bb8e5ada94228a28a62abfda15b610503d30ac5724a7b29c8e9c2a1cc9a:4;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/8b290c0ac552877de0d3fe79.png","chem-asset:e429d324fbb9588b2b8ceadedc6697beb3de97de12abf982df6eb2353dc45cf4:5;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/79e9f890a72930e74dc846fa.png","chem-asset:7d0049f04c619dbff6c77add34f7f4d40eeef9c6c28ac4d03d4b8bf54fa31a17:6;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/bafd5785146a5cce96803b3e.png","chem-asset:d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed:7;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/20e5a02aa142318a802006cd.png","chem-asset:7c2baf2285e55583d60c21307602ad1ca2b0cb04b00fe21753e47d5233cd385c:8;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/16d4a76ec5ccda16b4584af0.png","chem-asset:8ba1d31457e234a020983fe9628ff9fb2aa61b5412926482ea7a34434249dcc7:9;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3512b88acd0c71d84f27e219.png","chem-asset:2f71c1784d7e7ed3fbd58bf4530f726153fb16ef4038270a89c9e25dcbde6d8f:10;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/21a47a50d9c35430224df829.png","chem-asset:60c578b3203bdc57947db018051471fedaafe843b0b5e3b8dcad7378784468a6:11;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/70b31548e3d462f15c80816f.png","chem-asset:6002d7015809d896f8182060a847b53f5b4791ec895f1dccb69d3febf0d18237:12;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/1a1c2039b9fa4d68302a9085.png","chem-asset:6b2035571470f95241331dee9c08b0289a0ac92ce4dd821ddb4336a3b06f1dba:13;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/975e79c2cd98490429195167.png"},"sourceSha256":"43700a83425407ee177a8a342c9e686d23cb9df21a13f04e10c0c0905e60a5ea","bom":false,"legacyPath":"认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写/2026.5.28/P03-Q05_含铜物质转化离子方程式.html"},"2026.5.28:P05-Q09":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>电化学间接除氮废水</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.28 · 明德全真模拟 · 原题9 · P05-Q09</div><h1>电化学间接除氮废水</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/电解池</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：联系电极极性、次氯酸氧化和溶液酸度对除氮效率的影响。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/卤素及其化合物/氯气的性质及用途</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/影响化学平衡的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的量/物质的量及单位——摩尔</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：B  11    N  14    O  16    Sn  119</p><p>9. 如图为一种电化学间接处理废水中<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的装置。该装置采用<img src=\"chem-asset:bbbadaf8f6a7d98fd4f9264a0c228d34e4ad4a54091bc487642d9a1ee2602252:1;\" style=\"width:94.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为阳极材料，以可对溶液pH自适应调节的铝板为阴极材料。电解质溶液为含<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:a7ea9967395be6f0998c1a0138659ce10b76cd7908e9598aae7b360e417aa8aa:2;\" style=\"width:24.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的废水(含氮350 mg/L)。下列关于该装置的说法正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:ce75ee125dd0f0d0f7d68ed2cf7a9d87fadb1f870b724cf2df8f32d0c5149ca7:3;\" style=\"width:362.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 电解时a极应与直流电源的正极相连</p><p>B. 电解时b极处理<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的离子方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:0fb0654b0a1bfeab51f834f70f9320b42acb941d82c795c39a62bf1ba0196803:4;\" style=\"width:260.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 该装置工作时溶液酸性过强，会导致<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">去除效率降低</p><p>D. 每处理1 L废水，a极至少会产生0.84 L气体</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】电化学间接处理废水中<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的装置中，采用<img src=\"chem-asset:bbbadaf8f6a7d98fd4f9264a0c228d34e4ad4a54091bc487642d9a1ee2602252:1;\" style=\"width:94.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为阳极材料，电极a产生<img src=\"chem-asset:066ec03836e37939061574d886e795553111c52396a9c5ee587d85f5e267d1ec:5;\" style=\"width:22.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故电极a为阴极；电极b产生<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:6;\" style=\"width:24.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故为阳极。</p><p>【详解】A．电解时a极为阴极，应与直流电源的负极相连，A错误；</p><p>B．电解时b极处理<img src=\"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;\" style=\"width:35.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的过程是生成的HClO将废水中的<img src=\"chem-asset:4f5f60fd5572e9e0497b4ab818120820f193aba51ed8751c47b527d77cbf1cab:7;\" style=\"width:35.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:ad412953ce247a3e42fb706abde7c77ad7913f33fea5acc4773d85a6756d3dbd:8;\" style=\"width:22.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，HClO是弱酸，离子方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:79de19e806c8339309a340d0d433097e329ce0c4600db71c9132aefe6365379b:9;\" style=\"width:285.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B错误；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:404780d13e99c639824a8bb5322177bbeac9582ea5822014fa4d6a5fa5cced21:10;\" style=\"width:12.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">极产生的氯气会与水发生<img src=\"chem-asset:a4265592b5a6536e54907a70e071e84c4a1fe519f87957733f445a1966fec46b:11;\" style=\"width:205.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，当酸性过强时，<img src=\"chem-asset:f233213d399caee6eecf90a0ee342a9d45c27dabbf4caffe61697641eadcca9a:12;\" style=\"width:45.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">上升，导致反应逆移，<img src=\"chem-asset:27237f16c99f1615259d8088cab53d2afaac9a9bf56da6420c05cb598717ec4c:13;\" style=\"width:42.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">减少，<img src=\"chem-asset:4f5f60fd5572e9e0497b4ab818120820f193aba51ed8751c47b527d77cbf1cab:7;\" style=\"width:35.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">去除效率降低，C正确；</p><p>D．选项中未指明气体的状态，无法计算，D错误；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.28\\精品解析：湖南省长沙市明德中学等校2026届高三下学期全真模拟适应性考试化学试题\\精品解析：湖南省长沙市明德中学等校2026届高三下学期全真模拟适应性考试化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.28/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E6%98%8E%E5%BE%B7%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%85%A8%E7%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94%E6%80%A7%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E6%98%8E%E5%BE%B7%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%85%A8%E7%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94%E6%80%A7%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["066ec03836e37939061574d886e795553111c52396a9c5ee587d85f5e267d1ec","0fb0654b0a1bfeab51f834f70f9320b42acb941d82c795c39a62bf1ba0196803","27237f16c99f1615259d8088cab53d2afaac9a9bf56da6420c05cb598717ec4c","404780d13e99c639824a8bb5322177bbeac9582ea5822014fa4d6a5fa5cced21","4f5f60fd5572e9e0497b4ab818120820f193aba51ed8751c47b527d77cbf1cab","60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652","79de19e806c8339309a340d0d433097e329ce0c4600db71c9132aefe6365379b","a4265592b5a6536e54907a70e071e84c4a1fe519f87957733f445a1966fec46b","a7ea9967395be6f0998c1a0138659ce10b76cd7908e9598aae7b360e417aa8aa","ad412953ce247a3e42fb706abde7c77ad7913f33fea5acc4773d85a6756d3dbd","bbbadaf8f6a7d98fd4f9264a0c228d34e4ad4a54091bc487642d9a1ee2602252","cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81","ce75ee125dd0f0d0f7d68ed2cf7a9d87fadb1f870b724cf2df8f32d0c5149ca7","f233213d399caee6eecf90a0ee342a9d45c27dabbf4caffe61697641eadcca9a"],"refs":{"chem-asset:cdcd3f12507961d1026d03889336ae06760b3f704eda891e9c9594f558d75f81:0;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b11b55db77939ed847052a10.png","chem-asset:bbbadaf8f6a7d98fd4f9264a0c228d34e4ad4a54091bc487642d9a1ee2602252:1;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/e92da9806a46d290c26f85e3.png","chem-asset:a7ea9967395be6f0998c1a0138659ce10b76cd7908e9598aae7b360e417aa8aa:2;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3506c7aded71f3c56b72ffc1.png","chem-asset:ce75ee125dd0f0d0f7d68ed2cf7a9d87fadb1f870b724cf2df8f32d0c5149ca7:3;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/ce75ee125dd0f0d0f7d68ed2.png","chem-asset:0fb0654b0a1bfeab51f834f70f9320b42acb941d82c795c39a62bf1ba0196803:4;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3c84e1dd4ba2c5c1d5e8241d.png","chem-asset:066ec03836e37939061574d886e795553111c52396a9c5ee587d85f5e267d1ec:5;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/7434fcbc4fdddd3533406a71.png","chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:6;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/d69a97206263afecb06958b2.png","chem-asset:4f5f60fd5572e9e0497b4ab818120820f193aba51ed8751c47b527d77cbf1cab:7;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/6d3babfd492aa4996cbeba1c.png","chem-asset:ad412953ce247a3e42fb706abde7c77ad7913f33fea5acc4773d85a6756d3dbd:8;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/913f0d53eeb2ff03420370c4.png","chem-asset:79de19e806c8339309a340d0d433097e329ce0c4600db71c9132aefe6365379b:9;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/989a7be614367093e5f89f16.png","chem-asset:404780d13e99c639824a8bb5322177bbeac9582ea5822014fa4d6a5fa5cced21:10;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/20d73770ff2d93986df31e3d.png","chem-asset:a4265592b5a6536e54907a70e071e84c4a1fe519f87957733f445a1966fec46b:11;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/f9aeeb743f2b4aa6e5890b3c.png","chem-asset:f233213d399caee6eecf90a0ee342a9d45c27dabbf4caffe61697641eadcca9a:12;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/235e66cd844f6f47ad346d47.png","chem-asset:27237f16c99f1615259d8088cab53d2afaac9a9bf56da6420c05cb598717ec4c:13;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/879b7ff28b035ad5dbfb1372.png"},"sourceSha256":"9aed36b3c0902bc9d3fa4bdb735442e406354b94d44f650917492fbc6cac94e7","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学反应原理/电解池/2026.5.28/P05-Q09_电化学间接除氮废水.html"},"2026.5.28:P05-Q13":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>高铁酸钾制备及氧化氯离子探究</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.28 · 明德全真模拟 · 原题13 · P05-Q13</div><h1>高铁酸钾制备及氧化氯离子探究</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学实验基础/探究性实验/化学实验探究</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：利用稳定性与同离子效应分析析出洗涤，并排除残余氯气干扰。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/铁及其化合物/铁的其他化合物</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/影响化学平衡的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">化学实验基础/物质的分离、提纯</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：B  11    N  14    O  16    Sn  119</p><p>13. 已知：<img src=\"chem-asset:0b7d0cd6060c78d6f348de52d694376d85d47c407d4c05de4be80e1cc35bd733:0;\" style=\"width:55.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为紫色固体，微溶于浓<img src=\"chem-asset:5181ed5265d285179c2c93b91af52a40a75931e07529d758a4a157c9e9275c72:1;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，具有强氧化性，在酸性或中性溶液中快速反应产生<img src=\"chem-asset:b85cfa964ed474795563491595bb69cf4e97b9ebd726e13c5272e9aa9d520cac:2;\" style=\"width:21.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，在碱性溶液中较稳定。现利用如图装置(夹持装置略)制备<img src=\"chem-asset:0b7d0cd6060c78d6f348de52d694376d85d47c407d4c05de4be80e1cc35bd733:0;\" style=\"width:55.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，并设计以下方案探究<img src=\"chem-asset:0b7d0cd6060c78d6f348de52d694376d85d47c407d4c05de4be80e1cc35bd733:0;\" style=\"width:55.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">能否氧化<img src=\"chem-asset:a7ea9967395be6f0998c1a0138659ce10b76cd7908e9598aae7b360e417aa8aa:3;\" style=\"width:24.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">产生<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:4;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">：</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:943f4f3bc332110011897897aac4be9b7200dd944ea6eb9d74fd66fb49447f42:5;\" style=\"width:290.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>方案Ⅰ</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>取三颈烧瓶中的紫色溶液，加入稀硫酸，产生黄绿色气体，经检验，气体中含有<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:4;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>方案Ⅱ</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>将三颈烧瓶中所得固体洗涤干净，再用稀<img src=\"chem-asset:5181ed5265d285179c2c93b91af52a40a75931e07529d758a4a157c9e9275c72:1;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液将其溶解。取少量溶液，滴加足量盐酸，有<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:4;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">产生，向所得溶液中滴加<img src=\"chem-asset:7ecc18ba68bb3c7139e70f44c666b726ad5613b29cd18cbf613b157377f592fd:6;\" style=\"width:48.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，溶液呈红色</p></td></tr></table></div><p>下列说法错误的是</p><p>A. 三颈烧瓶中生成<img src=\"chem-asset:0b7d0cd6060c78d6f348de52d694376d85d47c407d4c05de4be80e1cc35bd733:0;\" style=\"width:55.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应的化学方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:301134ba6c688786cfc66086461625d36cb7fd17bc77ea43846d81561d7aaa51:7;\" style=\"width:327.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 三颈烧瓶中<img src=\"chem-asset:5181ed5265d285179c2c93b91af52a40a75931e07529d758a4a157c9e9275c72:1;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液过量的目的是提供碱性环境；增大<img src=\"chem-asset:6bb8ef142f6bf6f9e8463386f49c430867ab5639c3d5c67fc3a4a99240ebbed0:8;\" style=\"width:18.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">浓度，促进<img src=\"chem-asset:0b7d0cd6060c78d6f348de52d694376d85d47c407d4c05de4be80e1cc35bd733:0;\" style=\"width:55.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">析出</p><p>C. 方案Ⅰ和Ⅱ均能证明<img src=\"chem-asset:0b7d0cd6060c78d6f348de52d694376d85d47c407d4c05de4be80e1cc35bd733:0;\" style=\"width:55.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">可将<img src=\"chem-asset:a7ea9967395be6f0998c1a0138659ce10b76cd7908e9598aae7b360e417aa8aa:3;\" style=\"width:24.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:4;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. 方案Ⅱ中洗涤固体可用冷的浓氢氧化钾溶液</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．Fe(OH)<sub>3</sub>和Cl<sub>2</sub>在碱性条件下反应生成K<sub>2</sub>FeO<sub>4</sub>，Fe<sup>3+</sup>被氧化为+6价Fe，Cl<sub>2</sub>被还原为Cl<sup>-</sup>，反应方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:800e420a151c11e025301bd8ea72e2110c8d3972705170df8cda352c68d21fcc:9;\" style=\"width:333.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故A正确；</p><p>B．K<sub>2</sub>FeO<sub>4</sub>在碱性条件稳定，且微溶于浓KOH溶液，KOH提供碱性环境以稳定K<sub>2</sub>FeO<sub>4</sub>，同时增大K<sup>+</sup>浓度促进其析出，故B正确；</p><p>C．方案Ⅰ直接取紫色溶液加稀硫酸产生Cl<sub>2</sub>，体系中可能残留未反应Cl<sub>2</sub>，酸化后逸出，无法证明Cl<sub>2</sub>是否由K<sub>2</sub>FeO<sub>4</sub>氧化Cl<sup>-</sup>生成，方案Ⅱ将固体洗涤干净，可以除去残留的Cl<sub>2</sub>以及Cl<sub>2</sub>与碱反应的产物等可溶性杂质，加稀KOH溶液，加盐酸若产生Cl<sub>2</sub>，可以证明Cl<sup>-</sup>被氧化为Cl<sub>2</sub>，故C错误；</p><p>D．K<sub>2</sub>FeO<sub>4</sub>微溶于浓KOH，且用冷的浓KOH溶液洗涤可减少产物溶解损失，同时洗去表面杂质，故D正确；</p><p>故答案选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.28\\精品解析：湖南省长沙市明德中学等校2026届高三下学期全真模拟适应性考试化学试题\\精品解析：湖南省长沙市明德中学等校2026届高三下学期全真模拟适应性考试化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.28/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E6%98%8E%E5%BE%B7%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%85%A8%E7%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94%E6%80%A7%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF